      "content": "hey so im feeling kinda weird lately. i keep having these random moments where i just get super confused and like, i cant find the words for stuff im trying to say. it only lasts like 5 mins but it's scaring me a bit. do u think this is just like extreme brain fog from stress or maybe just not sleeping enough? i've been working a lot lately",
