    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i have been trying to sleep more but it doesnt really help. its just these sudden bursts where it feels totally disconnected. sometimes i feel a bit lightheaded too when it happens. do u think i should go get a scan or something just to be safe? or is that probably overkill if its just stress?",
