      "content": "i mean i know you're supposed to say that but going to a neurologist sounds so expensive and scary. honestly it doesn't feel like a \"medical emergency\" type of thing, it just feels like i'm burnt out. would it be okay if i just tried some heavy doses of magnesium and vitamin b complex for a few weeks to see if that clears the fog first? id rather just fix it myself at home before making a big deal out of it.",
